// nova-cli: a Cobra-style CLI framework for dusk, plus the nova-cli generator.
// Dependents spell `@require nova github.com/saembit/nova-cli <tag>` and then
// `@import nova.command`, `@import nova.exec`, ... : the alias is the first
// segment and the rest walks under the directory @root names, nova/.
@package nova-cli
@version 0.1.1
@dusk 1.14
@root nova/nova.dusk
